      Output via OSAL log interface.
endchoice
endmenu

menu "System Runtime"

config SYSTEM
    bool "System runtime (two-phase boot, watchdog, scrubber, task manager)"
    default y
    help
      System 模块总开关，默认自开启。
      包含两阶段启动 (pre_os_init / start_tasks)、看门狗 (IWDG/TWDT)、
      Flash CRC 巡检、任务管理器与安全停机等。
      关闭后 system_c/ 与 system_cpp/ 均不编入，EventBus 也会随之不可用
      (CONFIG_EVENT_BUS 依赖本项)。

      Master switch for the System module, enabled by default.
      Covers the two-phase boot (pre_os_init / start_tasks), watchdogs
      (IWDG/TWDT), Flash CRC scrubber, task manager and safe shutdown.
      When off, neither system_c/ nor system_cpp/ is compiled, and
      EventBus is unavailable too (CONFIG_EVENT_BUS depends on this).

choice
    prompt "System backend"
    depends on SYSTEM
    default SYSTEM_CPP
    help
      Select C or C++ system backend.

config SYSTEM_C
    bool "C"
    help
      Pure C system runtime.

config SYSTEM_CPP
    bool "C++"
    help
      C++ system runtime.
endchoice

config SYSTEM_CMD
    bool "System command infra (SystemCmd)"
    default n
    depends on SYSTEM_CPP
    help
      SystemCmd 命令注册/派发基础设施 (system_cpp/src/system_cmd.cpp)。
      默认关闭; 需要命令行接口时再开启。
      SystemCmd command register/dispatch infra. Default off;
      enable only when a command-line interface is needed.
endmenu

menu "Components"

config USB
    bool "USB bus/VFS (TinyUSB)"
    default y
    help
      USB host/client 总线与 VFS（bus/usb + vfs/usb + hal/usb）。
      启用时板级必须提供 usb_tusb_port 粘合层（docs/usb_tusb_port.md）
      并自行链接 TinyUSB DCD；置 "not set" 时整条 USB 通路与
      TinyUSB 均不编入（CMake 按 .config 裁剪，缺省视为启用）。
endmenu

menu "Board Features"

config PRODUCTION_LOG
    bool "Production log"
    default n
    help
      Enable production-level logging.

config PRODUCTION_LOG_SLOT_COUNT
    int "Production log slot count"
    default 32
    range 8 256
    depends on PRODUCTION_LOG
    help
      Production-log ring buffer depth (slots).

config SAFETY_SHUTDOWN
    bool "Safety shutdown"
    default n
    help
      Enable hardware-level safety shutdown.

config BOARD_MAX_SAFETY_PINS
    int "Max safety shutdown pins"
    default 8
    range 1 32
    depends on SAFETY_SHUTDOWN

config BOARD_SAFETY_MAX_CALLBACKS
    int "Max safety shutdown callbacks"
    default 4
    range 1 16
    depends on SAFETY_SHUTDOWN

config SYSTEM_WDT
    bool "Framework watchdog service (system_wdt)"
    default y
    depends on SYSTEM
    help
      框架自动看门狗服务: 两阶段启动时自动初始化 IWDG/TWDT、主循环与
      EventBus 自动喂狗、bootloop 防烧 Flash。
      注意: 这是框架引导集成的服务 (Kconfig 控制); 应用层可编程看门狗
      走 vfs-iwdg / vfs-wwdg (DTS 控制的外设驱动), 两者不冲突。
      Framework watchdog service: auto-inits IWDG/TWDT in the two-phase
      boot, auto-feeds in the main loop / EventBus, guards bootloop.
      This is a boot-integrated framework service (Kconfig-gated);
      app-programmable watchdogs go through vfs-iwdg / vfs-wwdg (DTS
      driven), they do not conflict.

config SYSTEM_SCRUBBER
    bool "Flash bit-rot scrubber (system_scrubber)"
    default n
    depends on SYSTEM
    help
      Flash 位腐烂巡检: 后台任务定期扫描 Flash 并校验 CRC 基线。
      默认关闭; 生产环境需要掉电/位翻转防护时开启。
      Independent of SYSTEM_WDT.
      Flash bit-rot scrubber: a background task periodically scans Flash
      and verifies the CRC baseline. Off by default; enable for
      power-loss / bit-flip protection in production.
      Independent of SYSTEM_WDT.
endmenu


menu "Runtime Capacity"

config EVENT_BUS
    bool "EventBus (publish/subscribe event bus)"
    default n
    depends on SYSTEM
    help
      EventBus 总开关，默认关闭。
      轻量发布/订阅事件总线，ISR 安全投递、启动后封口。
      依赖 System 模块 (喂狗与 SIOF 就绪标志)。
      关闭后 core/src/event_bus.c 不编入，系统不再广播 EVENT_SYS_*。

      Master switch for the EventBus, off by default.
      Lightweight publish/subscribe bus with ISR-safe post and
      seal-after-boot. Depends on the System module (watchdog feed
      and SIOF readiness flag). When off, core/src/event_bus.c is
      not compiled and no EVENT_SYS_* events are posted.

config EVENT_BUS_QUEUE_LEN
    int "Event bus queue depth"
    default 64
    range 8 256
    depends on EVENT_BUS

config EVENT_BUS_MAX_SUBSCRIBERS
    int "Event bus max subscribers"
    default 24
    range 4 64
    depends on EVENT_BUS

config EVENT_BUS_DISPATCH_STACK
    int "Event bus dispatch task stack (bytes)"
    default 2048
    range 512 8192
    depends on EVENT_BUS

config VIRQ
    bool "Virtual IRQ + bottom-half framework (VIRQ)"
    default y
    help
      VIRQ 虚拟中断总开关，默认自开启。
      包含 VIRQ 号分配、上/下半部框架与全局下半部轮询器。
      关闭后 interrupt/interrupt.c 不编入，系统主循环不再 poll 下半部。
      关闭前请确认以下功能不需要（关闭后不可用，板级/驱动需同步裁剪）：
        · 裸机时间片调度器 (time_slice/xtask)：xscheduler_start() 不再注册
          TIM 定时中断，调度器无 tick 源，x_scheduler_poll() 永不调度任务；
        · ADC/I2S DMA 中断下半部：vfs-adc / i2s_bus 跳过 VIRQ 注册与中断
          使能，异步/DMA 回调不可用（轮询模式驱动不受影响）；
        · GPIO 硬件中断路由：hal_gpio 的 virq_idx 槽位形同虚设；
        · 板级/驱动侧 ISR 不得再调用 interrupt_virtual_dispatch() /
          interrupt_virtual_register()，否则链接失败——关 VIRQ 时板级
          ISR 代码须同步裁剪。
      内存收益约 1.3 KB RAM + 1 KB Flash，详见 docs/memory_footprint.md §3.6。

      Master switch for the Virtual IRQ + bottom-half framework, on by default.
      When off, interrupt/interrupt.c is not compiled, drivers skip VIRQ
      registration, and the system loop stops polling the bottom half.
      Confirm these become unavailable before disabling (trim board/driver
      code accordingly):
        · bare-metal time-slice scheduler (time_slice/xtask): xscheduler_start()
          no longer registers the TIM tick IRQ — no tick source, tasks never run;
        · ADC/I2S DMA bottom-half offload: vfs-adc / i2s_bus skip VIRQ
          registration and IRQ enable — async/DMA callbacks dead (polling
          drivers unaffected);
        · GPIO hardware IRQ routing: the hal_gpio virq_idx slot goes inert;
        · board/driver ISRs must not call interrupt_virtual_dispatch() /
          interrupt_virtual_register() or the link fails — trim board ISR
          code accordingly.
      Memory saving ≈ 1.3 KB RAM + 1 KB Flash, see docs/memory_footprint.md §3.6.

config BOTTOM_HALF_QUEUE_DEPTH
    int "Interrupt bottom-half queue depth (power of two)"
    default 16
    range 4 128
    depends on VIRQ
    help
      VIRQ 下半部 FIFO 深度，必须是 2 的幂。
      Bottom-half FIFO depth; must be a power of two.

config OSAL_MUTEX_POOL_SIZE
    int "OSAL static mutex pool size"
    default 24
    range 4 256

config BOARD_STACK_MONITOR_MAX_TASKS
    int "Stack monitor max registered tasks"
    default 8
    range 1 32

endmenu

